title: "Wutapiu v6.2: Spectral Linguistic Artificial Intelligence Model with Sense Clouds"
abstract: >
  An artificial intelligence computer software  for natural language processing based on spectral
  representations and sense clouds for contextual disambiguation. Implements the
  Zero Mutation on Read principle, ensuring knowledge integrity during inference.
  Supports Spanish and English with SQLite persistence and learning through text ingestion.
